# calc.fdf template for the graphene optical folders (same idea as calc.fdf: no k-grid and no MD
# directives -- stb-optical forces them; a vacuum axis gets a single SCF k-point division).
SystemLabel siesta
%include structure.fdf

XC.functional GGA
XC.authors PBE
PAO.BasisType split
PAO.BasisSize TZP
PAO.EnergyShift 0.01 Ry
Mesh.Cutoff 300 Ry
Spin non-polarized

ElectronicTemperature 25 meV
DM.Tolerance 1.0e-6
